  - lineId: search_moteru_people_002
    speakerId: kayo
    expressionId: normal
    text: "あっ！ちょっとドウテっ！助けなさいっ……！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_003
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_003
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "この我から逃げ果せることなど不可能っ！ドウテくん左手あ〜げてっ！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_004
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_004
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "えっ！はいっ！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_005
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_005
    speakerId: kayo
    expressionId: normal
    text: "きゃあっ！ちょっと邪魔なんだけど……！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_006
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_006
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "はいっ捕まえた〜！まさか我との契りを忘れてはいまいな……？"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_007
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_007
    speakerId: kayo
    expressionId: normal
    text: "うぅ……！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_008
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_008
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "えっと、とりあえずノったけどなんの話？"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_009
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_009
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "お、気になる？気にしてる？気になっちゃうよね〜！いやむしろ木になるよねっ！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_010
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_010
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "いやそれはないけど"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_011
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_011
    speakerId: kayo
    expressionId: normal
    text: "こいつ、相変わらず元気ね……"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_012
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_012
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "むむっ！おふたりさんは息が合うね〜ヤキモチ妬いちゃうぞっ！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_013
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_013
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "ほらほらカヨちゃんも、ドウテくんとイチャついてないで！GOだよ！ツーショ撮ろっ！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_014
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_014
    speakerId: kayo
    expressionId: normal
    text: "あっこら……！ツーショットは撮るけどせめて着替えて……！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_015
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_015
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "行ってしまったぞ……"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_016
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_016
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "（どうやら2人はケッコウ仲良くなったみたいだ、むしろ仲良しすぎるけど。——そういえば、無意識に男女で考えていたけどこの時代だし必ずしも男女って訳じゃないよな……モテル……いやいや！さすがにっ！性別以外壁はないけどもっ！）"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_people_017
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_people_017
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "……適当に部屋を見て回るか"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: 
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_001
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "おぉ……！相変わらずこの本棚は豪華だ……！どんなのがあるのかなぁっと"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_002
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_002
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "わあぁ……！『音都このこは男の娘』だ！もう絶版になっちゃった伝説の漫画……！触れる日が来るなんて……！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_003
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_003
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "うわっ！興奮してぶつかっちゃった……"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_004
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_bookshelf_004
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "……？今、なにか落ちたような……"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: 
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_paper_001
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "なんだこれ、なにか文字が書いてある……『僕……ヒ……な……』うーん……頑張ってみたけどいまいち読めなさそうだな"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
    nextScenePath:
    nextLineId: search_moteru_paper_002
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: search_moteru_paper_002
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "破れてるみたいだし他の紙も見つければ組み立てて読めるかも……！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    fadeBeforeLine: 0
    lineFadeOutDuration: -1
    lineFadeHoldDuration: -1
    lineFadeInDuration: -1
